meta {
  name: Ezkey
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Ezkey API exploratory collection (Bruno).

  Shared environments under environments/ drive Admin, Auth, Integration, and Crypto API chaining.
  See README.md for install (local npm + npx bru) and scripts/bruno-health.sh suites.

  Collection auth is Bearer {{token}} for Admin folders (auth: inherit). Public/Crypto/Auth device
  folders override with auth: none / noauth as needed.

  Respond path defaults: env vars authAttemptAccepted (true) and authAttemptChallengeResponse (0).
}
